<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov fuel oil output down 17.72 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov fuel oil output down 17.72 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's fuel oil output totalled 20.9007 million tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, down 17.72 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Fuel oil production in November alone was 1.904 million tonnes, the bureau said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
